               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your patient, a 78-year-old male, admitted on 13/07/2022 with an acute exacerbation of his known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, he presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray showed hyperinflation without consolidation. Arterial blood gas analysis confirmed hypoxaemic respiratory failure. Blood tests revealed mild inflammatory markers elevation. ECG showed no acute cardiac changes. The patient was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and supportive intravenous fluids. Clinical response was satisfactory, with improvement in oxygen saturation and breathlessness. He was discharged on 14/07/2022 with oral prednisolone taper and optimised inhaler therapy. Please arrange follow-up spirometry and pulmonary rehabilitation referral. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
